;   width at 17; the run is MAXIMAL (byte before 0x1D); and the
;   end is not a guess -- 0xF156C8 is the `+7` pointer of the
;   eight opcode-02 records at 0xF157A8, which pass 7 as the entry
;   width and a mask of 0x1F, and 0xF156C8 + 32*7 = 0xF157A8, the
