;           one. The remap is the IDENTITY below 0x11: `cp (0x28B1),0x11 / jr
;           C` at 0xF5505E skips the -0x11 arm and `cp (0x28B1),0x1a / jr C`
;           at 0xF5507A skips the -9 arm, leaving HL as loaded at 0xF55023, so
