; SongStore_StepSizeTable -- the increment ladder for a held +/- key
;
; Read by:  one site, 0xF7CD6F `ld XDE,0x00F7CD98` then `ld L,(XDE+HL)` at
;   0xF7CD74, with HL = (0x0E18) zero-extended.
